      "description": "Official Spirit Contact Talker app. Take a look at the ratings—over 4,300 five-star reviews worldwide.\nSpirit Box • Ghost Talker • EVP Recorder • Ghost Detector • SLS (LiDAR) • EMF • Depth 3D Sensing\n\nTurn your iPhone into a complete paranormal investigation toolkit: run Spirit Box sessions, explore Ghost Talker responses, record EVPs, visualize possible figures with SLS/LiDAR*, and monitor EMF changes. Review sessions with optional post-session analysis to highlight patterns—never to generate audio. *LiDAR features require compatible devices.\n\nInvestigate your home, haunted locations, or anywhere that sparks your curiosity. Spirit Contact Talker combines multiple ghost hunting tools for paranormal enthusiasts and curious investigators. Run immersive ITC-style Spirit Box sessions using layered audio, phonemes, reversed fragments, and scanning-style sound textures. Using the Spirit Box, interpretation is personal—each session is a unique listening experience. Record and review EVP sessions separately to revisit unusual sounds and standout moments from your investigations. The app also includes SLS features and filters for further investigation.\nLanguages: Spanish and English.\n\nKey Features (Paranormal Investigation Toolkit for Enthusiasts)\n\t•\tSpirit Contact Talker feature: Ask questions and explore ITC-style responses. The app generates words and phrases during your sessions, creating an interactive,real-time experience you can interpret in your own way. Ideal for question-and-response sessions inside Spirit Talker.\n\t•\tSpirit Box: Experience the evolution of the classic ghost box. This tool scans frequencies to produce white noise and sound textures that may form word-like fragments during EVP sessions. New: Spirit Box Hit Alerts help you catch standout moments and tap Replay to re-listen to the last hit more clearly during your EVP session.\n\t•\tSLS Camera: Utilize advanced LIDAR technology to detect humanoid shapes in your surroundings. This feature maps out possible figure-like forms, adding a visual layer to your investigations.\n\t•\tGhost Detector: The app includes a reliable Ghost Detector for scanning energy shifts and frequencies often associated with paranormal activity. While it cannot scientifically confirm spirits' presence,  it serves as an engaging tool for paranormal enthusiasts.\n\t•\tDiscover Haunted Locations: Explore thousands of haunted locations across the USA and UK with the app’s Haunted Locations Map.\n\t•\tDepth Sensing: Enhances edges and depth contrast using depth sensing/LiDAR* to help visualize possible human-like shapes and spatial patterns.\nHow It Works:\n\t•\tAsk & Listen: Pose your questions into Spirit Talker feature and allow the app to provide words, sounds, or phrases in response.\n\t•\tHit & Replay: When the Spirit Box flags a hit, tap Replay to instantly re-check the last captured moment.\n\t•\tAI Session Analysis: Review your session with AI-assisted analysis that examines words, responses, context, and semantic patterns to help you interpret the experience.\n\t•\tEMF Detector: Detect anomalies like “cold spots,” often associated with ghost hunting.\n\t•\tVisualize with SLS: Detect and map humanoid shapes in real-time with LIDAR technology, adding an exciting visual layer to your investigations.\n\t•\tRecord & Review: Log details such as location, date, and environmental readings during your sessions for later review.\n\t•\tThe Spirit Box integrates layered audio elements, including phonemes, reversed audio, and other sound fragments, creating an immersive listening experience. These audio layers are designed to support EVP-style sessions with deeper interaction.\n\nUser Feedback (5 stars): Elliot – 20 dic. 2025 \nI was able to communicate with other spirits and see what spirit talker was like. I recommend it\n\nBring Spirit Box, Ghost Talker, EVP, EMF, SLS and more into your next paranormal investigation with Spirit Contact Talker.",
